The plan involves setting up a Rust project with Actix dependencies, creating a main function to initialize the web server, and defining a POST route `/convert` to handle file uploads. The implementation will include multipart form data handling to extract the uploaded zip file, using the `zip` crate to read its contents, validating the file types, and concatenating the text files' contents into a single string. The API will return a 200 status code for successful conversions and a 400 status code for invalid inputs.

